```python
def get_maxgold(grid, row, col):
    if row == 0 and col == 0:
        return grid[0][0]
    if row < 0 or col < 0 or row >= row or col >= col:
        return -float('inf')
    up = get_maxgold(grid, row-1, col)
    left = get_maxgold(grid, row, col-1)
    return grid[row][col] + max(up, left)
```

